# Global Rules

Use Python 3.12
Use Pygame framework.
Use type hints everywhere.
Avoid comments that explain obvious code.
Prefer composition over inheritance.
Keep functions under 40 lines when possible.
Follow SOLID principles where practical.
Do not introduce new dependencies without justification.

After completing a feature:

1. Update .cursor/tasks/current.md.
2. Remove task from .cursor/tasks/backlog.md when it is done.
2. Move completed tasks to .cursor/tasks/completed.md.
3. Add newly discovered issues to .cursor/tasks/known_issues.md.
4. Do not modify files in .cursor/rules directory unless explicitly requested.
5. Update README.md with appropriate info.